<title>POLAND: Warsaw bourse clears Stomil Sanok shares for trade.</title>
<headline>Warsaw bourse clears Stomil Sanok shares for trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The supervisory board of the Warsaw bourse cleared shares in Polish rubber producer Stomil Sanok SA for trade on the main market of the bourse, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>In the heavily oversubscribed November issue Stomil sold 500,000 new shares at 25 zlotys per share.</p>
<p>Stomil Sanok now has 5.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
